  "body": "A great opportunity to secure a modern four-bedroom home in Millwater! Offering approximately 166sqm of floor area, a flexible layout and low-maintenance living, this home is ideal for first-home buyers, young families or investors.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a small lounge near the entrance opens directly onto the fully fenced front outdoor area. The open-plan living and dining area enjoys good natural light, while the modern kitchen features dark cabinetry, plenty of bench space and storage. Large sliding doors open onto a sunny private deck, offering another spot to relax outdoors.\r\n\r\nThe flexible layout includes a downstairs bedroom and a separate toilet, ideal for guests, a home office or extended family. Upstairs, a good-sized living area enjoys plenty of natural light, along with three bedrooms, including the master with its own ensuite, and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n• 4 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n• Additional upstairs living area with plenty of natural light\r\n• Internal-access single garage\r\n• Additional off-street parking\r\n• Fully fenced, easy-care outdoor spaces\r\n\r\nWith local schools, Silverdale Shopping Centre and everyday amenities nearby, plus Orewa Beach and motorway access just a short drive away, everything you need is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
